t(29, 1800, """As I receive my fifty-first year tomorrow, if Allah the Exalted wills, on the first of August, here is a little of the essence of experience, of being shaped, then of understanding, by the grace of Allah the Exalted:

🔴 No one has any right with Allah except what Allah the Exalted decreed for His servants in His Book and approved for them out of His generosity, not as a right of theirs with Him, and what His Prophet ﷺ and his family conveyed in what is authentically reported from him
🔴 None of us will ever fully render the right of Allah the Almighty
🔴 No one migrates to Allah except that he becomes mighty and victorious in both abodes or in the Hereafter
🔴 No one contends with the decrees except that they overpower him
🔴 No one strikes the earth with his mouth and his feet except that he falls on his neck
🔴 There is no oppressor who does not desist except that the hour of his face blackening will certainly come
🔴 The Lord is not known through injustice, nor is the way to Him found by doing the deeds of the wretched, nor is He reached by persisting in a sin, even a small one
🔴 Neither displeasure nor anger changes the decree
🔴 The world is smaller than what is in the hearts of most people
🔴 The best supplication is asking for mercy in the Hereafter and insisting on it, and with it a good in this world, and the good is covering and a dignified living, not billions!
🔴 The magnifying of the self's share and of the world at the moment of prostration is a disgrace in the matter of faith
🔴 Wealth and clan are nothing before the manifestations of the ruling decrees of Allah the Almighty
🔴 In being secure at home, people have become like Qarun in loftiness and arrogance, except those whom Allah guided; for Qarun bought slaves to be his "might", just as relatives today buy one another with interests, so families have become two factions, or 100 factions!""")

t(30, 75, """🔴 Religion is exalted and nothing is exalted above it when we choose between the comfort of the world and the corruption of religion
🔴 Reform never comes through pulpits, but only through laws and the power of the state, its awe and its authority in truth and good
🔴 The world of capitalism was never strong in anything as people thought; rather it was the people who lived weak
🔴 Dozens of intellectual concepts people hold contradict the purposes of Allah the Exalted, and yet they are not ready to give them up

To be continued, by Allah the Exalted's permission,,,
🔴 The blind and the seeing will never be equal, whatever earthly means people take to make the one whose insight is blind see
🔴 Many things cannot be attained by earthly means, even if mankind and jinn gathered together to achieve them
🔴 The scholars who fear Allah are not those who studied the sciences; the scholars means those who knew and recognised Allah (the knowers). Not the scholars who study, graduate, preach and speak; never, the talk is only about (the knowers), and among them are those people never heard of at all across all the centuries of Islam
🔴 In every century there are those heedless of the way of the earlier peoples, so there is no escape from the mutual pushing back; whoever thinks the world of the reformers will not blaze as a scorching fire with this pushing back should correct his expectations
🔴 Most people in our time demand justice, truth and good, but when it comes many of them reject it, hate the hour of its arrival to them, and its moral bill weighs heavily on them.
🔴 If a servant angers his Lord, do not ask about the greatest punishment: "And We covered them, so they do not see"
🔴 Lethal divine punishments can be caused by a tiny lentil stuck in the throat; how many a croaker croaks every day with the croak of the ignorant runaway slave, saying: Who is mightier than me?!!
🔴 Whoever is humble, his name rises and becomes mighty, and whoever is arrogant, his name is lost and debased; so take heed, O people of insight

To be continued, by Allah the Exalted's permission,,,

🔴 There is no good in a woman who adorns herself for people while in her home she does not see her husband
🔴 There is no good in a man sweet of tongue with people and sharp-tongued with his wife and family
🔴 There is no good in a man who honours his parents and harms his children and wife
🔴 There is no good in a man who honours his wife and children and does not honour his parents
🔴 It is not lawful for a man to belittle a woman out of injustice and arrogance; if you do so you will certainly be humiliated, even after a while
🔴 No man humiliates his wife and children except that he is humiliated
🔴 No truth stands on falsehood, however much falsehood is adorned and gilded so that people see it as upright and sound
🔴 No one is safe from a humiliation he will hide from people if he has come to not respect himself between himself and himself
🔴 No one worships money except that he is certainly humiliated
🔴 No one pants after the world except that his breaths are cut off for nothing
🔴 No one believes that salvation lies in money except that he hungers with the hunger of humiliation, not the hunger of the healthy, nor the hunger of those brought near
🔴 No one among people is ignorant that all power belongs to Allah except that his self is set over him, the world is set over him, and those who do not fear Allah are set over him as a punishment, so he is humiliated

To be continued, if Allah the Exalted wills,,
🔴 A closed decree is not taken by asking and insisting
🔴 There is no relief except in its time and its season
🔴 There is no good in insisting on the answering of a supplication about worldly matters and their desires whose answer has been delayed
🔴 The term of injustice does not last long, and the weeping of the oppressed does not last
🔴 The weak does not stay weak forever, nor does the one who lords it over the servants stay strong forever, so there is no despair
🔴 Understanding does not petrify except through the petrifying of a heart
🔴 There is no planning of a servant except that the Lord's planning is better than it
🔴 There is no happiness sought in the world except that in which the whole matter is entrusted to the Lord
🔴 There is no one insisting and determined on a worldly matter in which he finds no success except that he is drifting away from what is right without knowing
🔴 The world does not stand by dirham or dinar; that is the standing of stations that do not last. In truth it stands by Allah, and that is the firm, tranquil standing of all time

To be continued, if Allah the Exalted wills,,
🔴 There is no righteous deed in the home and family except that it has fruits of blessing
🔴 There is no love by rulings, but there are rights; whoever fails in building love because of an injustice he committed should blame only himself
🔴 Love is not demanded with harshness; that is demanding the irrational and the illogical
🔴 Raising children is not scolding, clothing and cooking
🔴 Those who fail at upbringing would do better to hand their children to the state so they do not turn out mentally ill people to society
🔴 Those who do not understand the meaning of children and upbringing do not deserve to be married
🔴 The corruption of homes and the ruin of values has as its first, greatest and most widespread cause the fathers and mothers, not the children

To be continued, by Allah the Exalted's permission,,""")

